    "title": "NFPA: December Leading Month For Fires - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Friel ,\n17 hours ago Fire officials are urging caution over the next few weeks as December ranks as the leading month for home fires in America. Officials with the National Fire Protection Association, known as the NFPA, say there are a number of factors as to why the number of house fires spike this time of year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
